WEBVTT

00:01:37.310 --> 00:01:40.180
The kingdoms of Alto and Baritone
were nothing but trouble!

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:42.680
We went there after their
legendary magical vessels...

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:45.620
...and ended up being forced
to be thieves AND kidnappers!

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:48.720
Between their armies and Gravos
showing up for some reason...

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:50.790
...it all turned
into a collosal mess!

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:51.760
Hey! Gravos!

00:01:51.890 --> 00:01:53.990
Don't just go swinging that
Darkstar weapon around!

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:55.820
But, just then,
a light field appeared...

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:59.060
...that neutralized
the weapon's energy.

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:01.430
What the?! The legendary
vessels have the power...

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:04.800
...to fuse black magic
with holy magic?!

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:06.500
Light-Dark Fusion magic...

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:11.270
That may turn out to be the
ace we need to fight Valgaav!

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:22.480
<i>Anyway, we still have the five
Darkstar weapons to deal with.</i>

00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:27.820
<i>We'd heard a strange legend
that the last one is here...</i>

00:02:27.930 --> 00:02:30.620
<i>... and we've finally
reached this mountain, but...</i>

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:33.030
Unusual shape, isn't it?

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:34.030
Like a piece of sh...

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:38.870
Amelia! Stop that! That isn't a
word a royal princess should use!

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:39.700
R- Right!

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:40.930
But it clearly looks like sh...

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:42.030
Don't you start now!

00:02:42.110 --> 00:02:44.130
We call it Mt. Coronay.

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:48.470
Uh, Mt. Coronay is the
highest peak in the kingdom...

00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:50.680
...and is a great natural wonder!

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:53.620
Young people from all
over the world come here.

00:02:53.890 --> 00:02:56.010
To take advantage
of its mysterious power...

00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:58.920
...they cross that treacherous
bridge to begin the climb...

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:01.960
...to the temple atop its summit!

00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:07.930
Th- That bridge?

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:11.100
No need to cross it.
We can fly across in no time.

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:13.100
Hey, that's right.

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:14.870
Agh! You can't!

00:03:14.940 --> 00:03:18.140
No magic can be
used in this holy place!

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:20.310
It can't? Hmm...

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:22.580
Levitation!

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:26.340
I see...

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:30.580
So, that means...
We have to cross that bridge?

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:35.290
Oh, don't be such a wimp!
You like high places!

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:39.030
I don't mind heights, but I
like my feet on solid ground!

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:43.600
A mysterious power...
Do you know anything about it?

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:45.400
I'm not sure...

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:47.630
I didn't learn much
about other temples...

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:49.900
...at the temple of
the Fire Dragon King.

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:51.340
Unfortunately, neither do I.

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:55.850
Oh, well. Take us
to the temple, Mr. Guide.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:59.550
Please don't look up!

00:03:59.620 --> 00:04:01.680
That's easy for you to say!

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:10.400
Okay? Now what?

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:12.730
Each of you must spin this once.

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:15.170
Oh? Do we win
something if we do it?

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:16.030
No!

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:19.870
To enter the temple,
you must be in a boy-girl couple.

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:22.340
This determines who
your partner will be.

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:24.100
COUPLES?!

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:26.040
Ridiculous.

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:31.550
Only people with truly
compatible hearts may enter!

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:35.380
When you spin, those who get balls of
the same color are the best couples.

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:39.150
The temple of Mt. Coronay is dedicated
to the god of marriage, after all.

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:40.820
The... The god of marriage?!

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:45.030
Lina, suspicious places
are our best bet!

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:45.960
I know, I know!

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:48.390
Okay, then,
I have to spin this, right?

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:49.940
Here goes!

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:56.140
Okay, I'm next!

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:58.040
Truth and Justice can
give only one answer!

00:04:58.250 --> 00:05:00.110
Well, I still
say it's ridiculous.

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:02.040
The god of marriage, huh?

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.010
Well, I'll go along with it...

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:11.560
This is the god's best match-up?!

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:15.060
Me and Zel, huh?
Well, glad to have you.

00:05:15.130 --> 00:05:16.290
Be gentle with me.

00:05:16.430 --> 00:05:19.920
I'm blue, so I go with Amelia?

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:23.770
This has to be a mistake!

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:26.200
Mr. Gourry has
to go with Miss Lina!

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:29.270
What are you talking about,
Amelia? It doesn't matter to me.

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:32.840
Huh? Well, if you say so, Miss Lina...

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:37.640
But I still feel like I'm
doing something wrong to you.

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:41.720
J-Just a minute here!

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:44.350
I object! I refuse to
accept this coupling!

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:47.050
As do I! I won't
go along with it!

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:48.330
That's right!

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:51.430
Does that thing even choose
us on any basis at all?

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:52.900
What, now you, too?

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:55.830
All is according to the
will of the great heavens.

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:58.130
If the chosen
combinations are broken...

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:00.470
...you can't go into Mt. Coronay!

00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:04.940
Well, you can forget an
incompatible combo like THIS!

00:06:06.110 --> 00:06:08.170
You look pretty
compatible to me...

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:12.410
Oh, well.
Well, Lina, I'll be off then.

00:06:12.490 --> 00:06:15.250
Wha?! Hey!
What's the big idea, Xellos?!

00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:18.190
<i>If getting into the temple
means pairing up with Filia...</i>

00:06:18.260 --> 00:06:21.790
<i>... then I'd rather be keeping a record
on the nature of morning-glories!</i>

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:23.830
<i>You all do a good job in there!</i>

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:28.190
You self-centered priest! You
arranged for us to go to this temple!

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:29.740
Deal with it!

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:32.370
God knows the rest of us are.

00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:33.700
And what's that supposed to mean?

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:35.330
Exactly the way it sounds!

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:38.210
What's with you?
You mad at me for something?

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:39.070
Don't ask me!

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:42.140
Xellos and I, compatible?

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:46.850
With that demon? Me?

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:50.650
You, too, Filia! Don't you want
us to get that Darkstar weapon?

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:54.180
That's pretty irresponsible for a
priestess of the Fire Dragon King.

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:57.160
The ones who have to follow the
prophecy are YOU people, Miss Lina.

00:06:57.230 --> 00:06:59.530
I can think of myself once
in a while, can't I?!

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:00.500
Wha?!

00:07:00.630 --> 00:07:03.360
Oh, really? If that's your
reasoning for using us...

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:04.930
...you're no different than Xellos!

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:09.870
With the tiny salary I have to
live on, how can you say that?!

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:11.880
I'm about ready to punch her out!

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:12.840
Now, calm down.

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:15.640
What's up?
What's wrong with everyone?

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:17.640
Peace is best, right?

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:20.050
It's your fault, too,
for being clueless, Mr. Gourry!

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:24.720
Oh, enough of this. Sit there
and cry all day if you want!

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:27.050
Amelia, what are you gonna do?!

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:29.060
Let's go! We have to go!

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:33.190
Now, then, each couple will
climb the mountain arm in arm.

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:34.100
It's the custom.

00:07:35.670 --> 00:07:37.260
Arm in arm?

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:41.670
Purify the mind, purify the heart...

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:45.100
I feel a little embarrassed.

00:07:46.010 --> 00:07:47.540
It's a bit out of character.

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:50.070
Something on your mind?

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:52.080
Yeah. It's Xellos...

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:53.380
Oh, right.

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:59.020
I don't think he's following
us around just for fun.

00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:01.790
Definitely.
Something's going on.

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:04.160
You're getting really tall!

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:06.390
Naturally. It runs in my family.

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:10.290
My big sister's about as
tall as you are, Mr. Gourry!

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:11.960
Sounds scary.

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:13.030
She is!

00:08:13.310 --> 00:08:16.540
Hey, you seem like you're
in a bad mood. You hungry?

00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:17.600
Not really!

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:22.210
<i>I am acting like a real brat.
What's wrong with me?</i>

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:28.220
<i>This isn't fair!</i>

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:40.870
Whoa! So, this is the temple
of the god of marriage, huh?

00:08:41.800 --> 00:08:45.140
Our objective is just
through that entrance.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:46.930
Stay on good terms
with each other...

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:01.380
W-W-What's the big idea?!
It's shaking!

00:09:01.460 --> 00:09:03.980
This is a
true wonder of nature!

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:05.290
Ugh, I'm gonna be sick!

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:12.130
Yeesh...
I'm definitely gonna be sick!

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:15.460
There's nothing unusual in here.
It's just a temple.

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:19.340
Hey, mister. Where's that
mysterious power you mentioned?

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:24.500
The god of marriage who holds the
mysterious power is further inside.

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:26.880
This part up ahead is unlit, though.

00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:29.610
Be careful you don't get lost.

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:32.550
Wow... I can't see anything.

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:53.000
All right! We're through!

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:55.900
Where's Gourry?

00:09:56.710 --> 00:10:00.150
But he was right behind me!

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:03.970
Great... That jellyfish brain!
He was warned to stay with us!

00:10:04.050 --> 00:10:08.150
Hey, Lina? Zel? Amelia?

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:13.180
<i>Hey, Lina? Zel? Amelia?</i>

00:10:15.030 --> 00:10:19.930
That's funny... Oh, I know!
They all must have gotten lost!

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:22.590
Man, those guys are hopeless.

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:29.000
Oh, great! How could you
not notice Gourry was gone?!

00:10:29.180 --> 00:10:32.370
What stupid stuff were you
thinking about, Amelia?!

00:10:32.450 --> 00:10:34.710
Stupid stuff? That's not true.

00:10:34.850 --> 00:10:38.150
I couldn't see anything back there!
It wasn't my fault!

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:42.180
Ooh... What could have
happened to the poor guy?

00:10:42.260 --> 00:10:47.020
If you're so worried, maybe you
should have paired up with HI M!

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:51.190
In any case, YOU were
Gourry's partner today!

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:53.430
That makes losing him YOUR fault!

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:58.460
But! Miss Lina,
you're acting weird today!

00:10:58.540 --> 00:10:59.770
How am I weird?

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:01.500
Stop it right now, Lina!

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:05.530
We ALL know Gourry's stupid.
This isn't getting us anywhere.

00:11:05.610 --> 00:11:07.050
What's with you two?

00:11:07.110 --> 00:11:10.140
Do I have to remind you that
it was YOU TWO who broke those...

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:12.550
...magical vessels we went
through so much trouble for?!

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:16.250
Stop bringing up stuff we
can't do anything about!

00:11:16.890 --> 00:11:20.090
Hey! Everyone! Where are you?

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:24.490
They're all mean to me!
They're ALL mean to me!

00:11:26.270 --> 00:11:28.830
<i>What's going on here?
Everyone's being an idiot!</i>

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:32.340
<i>I swear, I'm gonna get
back at Miss Lina for this!</i>

00:11:49.160 --> 00:11:54.300
Hey! Everyone! Where are you?
I can't see anything...

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:57.900
Lina! Zel! Amelia!

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:01.630
Are you over here?

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:04.580
What was that?!

00:12:06.110 --> 00:12:10.240
Lina? No, definitely not her.
Breasts are too big for Lina.

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:14.380
Oh, well. HEY! HEY!

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:23.630
The god's statue is in here.
The floor is a complicated trap.

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:26.900
Take the wrong step and you
will feel the god's punishment!

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:30.230
Understand? Each couple must
move together upon a set path...

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:33.970
...across the black
and white tiles!

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:35.940
Make a mistake and
you will be punished!

00:12:36.010 --> 00:12:37.040
Scary, huh?

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:38.770
Each couple?

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:46.590
Ready?! Come, destined lovers!
Take your first step there!

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:49.350
I've got it!

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:51.420
Dunno what it is,
but the fastest one wins!

00:12:51.890 --> 00:12:52.760
That's no fair!

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:54.160
I'm first!

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:55.590
I can't believe
how greedy she is!

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:56.720
I won't let you win!

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:00.630
Agh! God's punishment!
God's punishment!

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:04.910
All right! I got it...

00:13:07.310 --> 00:13:10.340
Wh- What is this?
Is the statue of the god?

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:14.440
You idiots are
making the god angry!

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:16.280
You're gonna DI E! Honestly!

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:20.050
Now, look! Where's this
"mysterious power" of yours?!

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:22.490
Yeah! This is starting
to smell like a rip-off!

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:29.700
I figured a story about
"mysterious power"...

00:13:29.770 --> 00:13:32.700
...would bring you
greedy people here!

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:39.130
And my plan to divide your
power worked perfectly!

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:41.440
Wait a minute... You're!

00:13:55.360 --> 00:13:56.480
The goon squad, huh?

00:14:24.820 --> 00:14:26.880
Wh- What's the big idea?!

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:31.520
Light, come forth!

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:39.930
Jillas?!

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:42.700
Right now, my men are
getting the Sword of Light...

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:45.170
...from your now
isolated friend Gourry.

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:46.370
My plan is perfect!

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:50.200
Plan? Then... That whole ball
fortune teller thing was?

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:52.440
Yes! All part of the plan!

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:56.980
You divided us up into couples
to exploit our weaknesses...

00:14:57.050 --> 00:14:59.610
...and then used it for
psychological warfare!

00:14:59.690 --> 00:15:03.180
How terrible! How inhuman!

00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:06.220
Looks like we
underestimated you.

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:09.900
And while my men get
the Sword of Light...

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:11.430
...I'll take care of YOU!

00:15:11.830 --> 00:15:14.730
Oh? Who's gonna take
care of who, here?

00:15:15.070 --> 00:15:17.160
You're really getting
full of yourself...

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:19.330
...just 'cuz your plan
managed to work.

00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:31.910
What was that?

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:37.920
Wh-Wh-What's going on here?!

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:41.320
This floor is mined!

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:44.890
And you were so caught up in
fighting each other to be first before...

00:15:44.970 --> 00:15:49.800
...that you don't remember
where the safety zone is!

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:55.240
I've whipped up a special new kind
of gunpowder for this occasion.

00:15:55.310 --> 00:15:57.640
It's 30 times more explosive
than my normal stuff!

00:15:57.710 --> 00:16:02.120
So, unless we're careful,
we'll bring down this whole temple.

00:16:02.380 --> 00:16:04.510
You've really outdone
yourself this time.

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:06.780
And with you all unable
to use your magic...

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:08.520
...you can't take
a step anywhere!

00:16:08.590 --> 00:16:11.120
And blowing up an
unmoving target's easy!

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:12.420
Say your prayers!

00:16:23.440 --> 00:16:26.700
This isn't it!
Where's my sword? My sword!

00:16:35.980 --> 00:16:39.320
Hey, you guys! Don't you dare!

00:16:39.820 --> 00:16:44.020
Come on, Miss Lina! Now that we
know we've fallen into an enemy trap...

00:16:44.090 --> 00:16:48.260
...it's time we put our differences
aside and joined forces!

00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:50.350
And do what, exactly?

00:16:50.430 --> 00:16:51.560
Um, well...

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:56.200
At the very least, we know that
the square he's on is safe!

00:16:56.940 --> 00:17:00.430
If I can get within a sword-length
of him, he'll naturally move away.

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:03.640
Then we just move
wherever he moves to.

00:17:03.810 --> 00:17:07.440
All right! And let's bet on my woman's
intuition finding the first block!

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:08.610
What?!

00:17:09.220 --> 00:17:12.980
Woman's intuition?! That's the
LAST thing we can depend on!

00:17:17.690 --> 00:17:18.620
Safe!

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:25.660
Dammit! We need to
take another step!

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:28.100
Whoa! Don't push!

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:31.800
Easy for you to say!
There's no room on here!

00:17:32.140 --> 00:17:34.400
Where is it? Where is it?
Where is it? My sword!

00:17:34.480 --> 00:17:37.670
Where is it?! Where is it?!
Where is it?! Where is it?!

00:17:42.420 --> 00:17:44.580
That's MI NE!

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:50.260
It's your fault the
Boss disappeared!

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:52.230
Now I'll have my revenge!

00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:55.260
One, two, three...

00:17:55.830 --> 00:17:57.460
Keep that thing away from us!

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:20.240
Thunder?
I wonder if it's going to rain.

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:24.020
Wait! Give that back!
You dirty thief!

00:18:44.650 --> 00:18:45.980
LIGHT, COME FORTH!

00:18:52.890 --> 00:18:55.720
Sorry, guys, but you lose.

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:04.560
Oh, man!

00:19:04.630 --> 00:19:06.830
Dammit! We're back
where we started from?

00:19:10.470 --> 00:19:12.000
Now you're finished!

00:19:12.340 --> 00:19:15.000
How'd this stupid little beast
man get us in such a pinch?!

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:18.310
These aren't like the
guns you saw last time!

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:19.710
Prepare to die!

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:21.480
You are really!

00:19:28.820 --> 00:19:30.020
Hey!

00:19:30.530 --> 00:19:32.360
What's going on, guys?

00:19:32.760 --> 00:19:34.230
So, is this where you all are?

00:19:34.300 --> 00:19:34.950
Gourry!

00:19:35.300 --> 00:19:37.420
Agh! No! No!
Don't come near us!

00:19:37.930 --> 00:19:41.870
Man! You wouldn't believe
what I had to go through!

00:19:41.940 --> 00:19:44.840
But, see?
I protected the Sword of Light!

00:19:45.170 --> 00:19:47.470
No, you idiot!
Stay back! No!

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:49.440
Huh? What's that?

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:11.930
Gods, please forgive me!

00:20:17.870 --> 00:20:19.640
Jellyfish brains!

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:23.010
Do you know how much trouble
WE had to go through?!

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:27.280
Well, maybe you did, but I had
to defend this thing...

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:29.150
It's gone!

00:20:33.720 --> 00:20:35.550
Damn them...

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:46.900
The real Sword of Light...
I got it!

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:49.500
I GOT IT!

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:52.110
Come back here with that!

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:58.310
<i>I don't believe it!
Beaten by that little idiot!</i>

00:20:58.380 --> 00:21:02.150
<i>And that's all I'm gonna say
about this latest development!</i>

00:22:22.500 --> 00:22:25.830
Darn it! What did you steal
the Sword of Light for, anyway?!

00:22:25.970 --> 00:22:28.630
We'll follow you straight
down to hell to get it back!

00:22:28.700 --> 00:22:31.730
Next time, " Selfless and Senseless!
Pursuit Through the Labyrinth!"

00:22:31.810 --> 00:22:34.600
You'd better watch, or I'll
REALLY cause some trouble!
